OL,3,GNEWSA'Fascinating' rare beetle found in
OL,4,AWales again after 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare species of beetle has been found
OL,7,Fin Pembrokeshire after not being seen
OL,8,Fin Wales for 60 years.
OL,10,FThe Short-Necked Oil Beetle is named
OL,11,Fafter the adult beetles' stubby shape
OL,12,Fand its ability to secrete an oily
OL,13,Fyellow-orange substance from its knee
OL,14,Fjoints when alarmed.
OL,16,FThey were not reported in the UK for
OL,17,Falmost 60 years after 1948 as habitat
OL,18,Floss brought the species to the brink
OL,19,Fof extinction.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
